#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:7
#: b065c245547249d2896de3be7e72d02b
msgid "Flight Time Recorder"
msgstr "飞行时间记录器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:9
#: 9433b746ad314abaad3e5c59bdf90254
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes a flight time recorder which records the board's total "
"flight time, total run time and number of times the board has been rebooted."
"  These are stored in user resettable parameters meaning they are not "
"protected from being tampered with."
msgstr "ArduPilot内置飞行时间记录器，记录飞控板的总飞行时间、总运行时间和重启次数。这些数据存储在用户可重置的参数中，因此不能防止被篡改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:14
#: 13a9cab1ca994bd68d06ab38605c137f 3bf5c07d63a24b1298d605b1a6fa3fda
#: 7f0f85ab8844464b8be880c8e426fc66 7f44bf47a75846619880ddac7e3947fd
#: e30dce7af52e4ffd9a8f8d73877fc2c4
msgid "Parameter Details"
msgstr "参数说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:16
#: 016bb53b420a4a8ba16d8de6129327bf 1cd7f61503f34f5a92181e1f41414ca9
#: 4bbe23f204684bc28f194aa4b1c664f0 6d132cf9a819453eb2cf7d4351675abc
#: d6fffc99aa4844ce810411b6c9096fc4
msgid ""
":ref:`STAT_BOOTCNT <STAT_BOOTCNT>` holds the number of times the board has "
"been booted"
msgstr ":ref:`STAT_BOOTCNT <STAT_BOOTCNT>` 保存飞控板的启动次数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:17
#: 4b87a202722845a09796fb90eb2f3bf2 84979ed42f194e2cb803d7ed4ce24a45
#: c781bdc31fc249c0a10cf22beeeeb0cf e4e60b90801841a2a3750c68941d32d0
#: fb0ed56b698c476eab75f4e3508feba4
msgid ""
":ref:`STAT_FLTTIME <STAT_FLTTIME>` holds the total number of seconds that "
"the board/vehicle has been flying (including all previous flights)"
msgstr ":ref:`STAT_FLTTIME <STAT_FLTTIME>` 保存飞控板/飞行器的累计飞行秒数（包含所有历史飞行）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:18
#: 06d692427dfc4d24ae02b2809478eb20 36b39cb4ddeb43ba85e5ac411470cdaf
#: 371f960bbcb54949b4394737ebc288f2 5b10206a99b244638900a45f6c7e4736
#: 678d166b56cb45dd8cc17d15d96ce335
msgid ""
":ref:`STAT_RUNTIME <STAT_RUNTIME>` holds the total number of seconds that "
"the board has been powered up (including all previous flights)"
msgstr ":ref:`STAT_RUNTIME <STAT_RUNTIME>` 保存飞控板的累计通电秒数（包含所有历史飞行）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:19
#: 3552d91fcc034f5d8fef73b4964d9d41 36046de8ca9a49dd9d487a1e35712443
#: 59b284fe429843599dcba483507afee9 5bdc12ae148c40dfaea602dafc473a2f
#: f4c1030ec8f44cc899f4cb6850252938
msgid ""
":ref:`STAT_RESET <STAT_RESET>` hold the number of seconds after epoch (1st "
"Jan 1970) since the statistics were reset if the board has a GPS to provide "
"a real time.  Without a GPS the time will be something close to 1st Jan "
"1970.  The user can trigger a reset of all statistic by setting this "
"parameter to \"0\".  This parameter will then immediately be reset again to "
"the current time since epoch and all other parameters set back to zero."
msgstr ""
":ref:`STAT_RESET <STAT_RESET>` "
"保存统计数据被重置时距纪元（1970年1月1日）的秒数，前提是飞控板有GPS提供实时时间。若无GPS，时间将接近1970年1月1日。用户可将此参数设置为「0」来触发所有统计数据重置。该参数将立即被重置为当前距纪元的时间，其他参数归零。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:22
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:24
#: 34a7cf0da5c24181b8c83a352a4a1637 4e6c771ba605468597a8e52f9ba3645d
#: 56f14d653f234f10aeb9c1e2b2d615d2 699a9968b2ae4bc1a7184a00aa4087ca
#: 917a82b13d814afca115ec04e2af8b4a
msgid "When will counters be reset?"
msgstr "计数器何时会被重置？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:24
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:26
#: 2c1208fecf0346f0af5b73b54a0db954 4e771fe6142d4889810dc6faf181aeb9
#: 60d0dc0f531749b8baf32bf03dffb491 c6053a91858340dc8b511c07d5163599
#: f2260bcd023744fd959c552b50750166
msgid ""
"The STAT parameters will not be cleared when upgrading/downgrading firmware "
"versions of a particular vehicle type (i.e. upgrading from Copter-3.4 to 3.5"
" will not clear the parameters)."
msgstr "STAT参数在同一机型固件版本升级/降级时不会被清除（例如从Copter-3.4升级到3.5不会清除参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:26
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:28
#: 197b0d0eef034d80a3b950c39f17a176 2e859ab7bbe247ef84bb66713d884da0
#: 63414b6c833449bcacb4584fe04d5a09 929ca050f9e041b0add45a66f49a2899
#: d7f67e166c424153b837b09444f03a99
msgid ""
"The parameters are not protected meaning they can be changed by the user.  "
"In addition they may be reset when:"
msgstr "这些参数不受保护，意味着用户可以修改。此外，在以下情况下可能被重置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:28
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:30
#: 34c1280d020d4e56bd8118662d67020d 3c761fac0e4946b9bc166d98b6f954a6
#: 526e186ff96c45c49a0fe68da565fe88 56f6701da01743e9ba998f5086a55a49
#: a0dcdb3eb3ef40a09e4e16f5432172ce
msgid ""
"a different vehicle code is written to the board which clears all parameters"
" (i.e. loading a copter firmware onto a board which was running the plane "
"firmware)"
msgstr "向飞控板写入不同机型代码时会清除所有参数（例如将原本运行固定翼固件的飞控板刷入多旋翼固件）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:29
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:31
#: 0e92323502834eb68e3509dc914a540c 668f64bd7f2d443193094b3cfa4e5c36
#: 716386f7bb4a4096b0b330e6dd8eb2f9 7512ffa701e84b8b997b2c75460111d4
#: c01e3286bffc4863a15d2bccef676d0b
msgid "user performs a :ref:`parameter reset <common-parameter-reset>`"
msgstr "用户执行 :ref:`参数重置 <common-parameter-reset>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:7
#: 2e7717d2ae6041d486653d981eee1ccb 48fe3b11e89042608dd2b92f7dae7352
#: 9050c5232b784e20b1f59e138ea5a69f f09514dbac154846985463332991e95a
msgid "Flight Statistics"
msgstr "飞行统计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:9
#: 0185e6d2d0164a97827f48e091555fc3 2c0ca5e7f6c64428ae865eeb9e509763
#: a4393d292a1340d79663728056915646 e64c802ed2414d7381a902796ea7f10d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes a flight time recorder which records the board's total "
"flight time, total run time and number of times the board has been rebooted."
" Numbers of flights and total distance flown (if location sensing is "
"available) are also provided. These are stored in user re-settable "
"parameters meaning they are not protected from being tampered with."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"内置飞行时间记录器，记录飞控板的总飞行时间、总运行时间以及重启次数。还提供飞行次数和总飞行距离（如有位置传感数据）。这些数据保存在用户可重置的参数中，因此无法防止被篡改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:20
#: 3cfeb3b719234908a1ece855dc4aa61f 5ab715c2872046efa7ea04120dbe66ec
#: 73baa4d6342b4163aab1a638ae035e52 8fb73ed2fc6a49d0b1b24bf62ae76e54
msgid ":ref:`STAT_FLTCNT <STAT_FLTCNT>` holds the total number of flights"
msgstr ":ref:`STAT_FLTCNT <STAT_FLTCNT>` 保存总飞行次数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-time-recorder.rst:21
#: 715f4b973a3b4afe83c944fa451a842a b19cd664b90843aa8eb9d9ebcc4e90ff
#: d6dab1a6146049cca39b596d9473187a e05d453be2444df69550852d77760029
msgid ""
":ref:`STAT_DISTFLWN <STAT_DISTFLWN>` holds the total distance flown, "
"assuming valid location is available during the flights"
msgstr ":ref:`STAT_DISTFLWN <STAT_DISTFLWN>` 保存总飞行距离（前提是飞行期间有有效的位置信息）"
